records.rationale:
In `packages/core/EventManager.ts`, the diff adds:
```ts
const [mainHostDestinationCalendar] = evt.destinationCalendar ?? [];
if (evt.location === MeetLocationType && mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration !== "google_calendar") {
  evt["location"] = "integrations:daily";
}
```
If `evt.destinationCalendar` is `null` or an empty array, `mainHostDestinationCalendar` is `undefined`, and accessing `mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration` will throw a TypeError. This is reachable because the diff also introduces callers that can set `destinationCalendar` to `null` (e.g. `handleNewBooking.ts` sets
